{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771234562943,"sessionID":"ses_39a387835ffeQXkadxFvThlMO2","part":{"id":"prt_c65ce9370001ieeKL7NlwxrJXz","sessionID":"ses_39a387835ffeQXkadxFvThlMO2","messageID":"msg_c65ce78cb001N0wwwswbSFOELz","type":"tool","callID":"call_4bd6806772a54460bc3bc4e8","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md","limit":50,"offset":1398},"output":"<path>/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>1398: ### 6.2 Accessibility (LOW - Inclusivity)\n1399: \n1400: - [ ] Implement keyboard navigation\n1401:   - Arrow keys for grid navigation\n1402:   - Enter/Space to place cells\n1403:   - Escape to cancel/close panels\n1404:   - Tab navigation through UI controls\n1405: - [x] Add screen reader support (COMPLETED 2026-02-16)\n1406:   - ARIA labels for UI elements\n1407:   - Announce game state changes\n1408:   - Alternative text for visual elements\n1409:   - Live regions for score/timer updates\n1410: - [x] Implement reduced motion support\n1411:   - Respect prefers-reduced-motion media query\n1412:   - Disable animations when requested\n1413:   - Simplified visual feedback\n1414: - [ ] Add high contrast mode\n1415:   - Toggle for high contrast colors\n1416:   - Larger text option\n1417:   - Improved readability\n1418: - [x] Ensure minimum touch targets\n1419:   - 44×44px minimum for mobile\n1420:   - Spacious clickable areas\n1421: - [ ] Focus management\n1422:   - Visible focus indicators\n1423:   - Logical tab order\n1424:   - Focus trap in modals\n1425: \n1426: **Dependencies**: UI components, user interaction\n1427: \n1428: **Implementation Summary (Screen Reader Support - 2026-02-16):**\n1429: \n1430: - Added ARIA labels to all buttons in GlassHUD (STEP, START/RUNNING, RANDOM, CLEAR, DRAW, ERASE, Small/Medium/Large, Show/Hide Grid, Settings)\n1431: - Added aria-pressed to toggle buttons (DRAW/ERASE modes, grid size presets, Show/Hide Grid)\n1432: - Added aria-live=\"polite\" regions to ScoreDisplay, FluxDisplay, and GlassHUD status items\n1433: - Added aria-label to score and high score displays with descriptive text\n1434: - Added aria-label to FluxDisplay with available flux information\n1435: - Added aria-label to IntroOverlay, VictoryScreen, ErrorBoundary buttons\n1436: - Added role=\"alert\" and aria-live=\"assertive\" to ErrorBoundary for error announcements\n1437: - Added role=\"dialog\" and aria-modal=\"true\" to SettingsPanel\n1438: - Added role=\"img\" and dynamic aria-label to Canvas element describing alive cell count\n1439: - Created Announcer component with sr-only class for screen reader announcements\n1440: - Integrated Announcer into Game component with phase-based announcements:\n1441:   - Planning phase: Announces level number and instructions\n1442:   - Countdown phase: Announces simulation starting soon\n1443:   - Running phase: Announces simulation progress and remaining time\n1444:   - Finished phase: Announces level completion\n1445:   - Level transition: Announces level completion with score and next level\n1446:   - Victory: Announces completion of all levels with total score\n1447: - Added .sr-only CSS class to index.css for visually hidden but accessible content\n\n(File has more lines. Use 'offset' parameter to read beyond line 1447)\n</content>","title":"IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md","metadata":{"preview":"### 6.2 Accessibility (LOW - Inclusivity)\n\n- [ ] Implement keyboard navigation\n  - Arrow keys for grid navigation\n  - Enter/Space to place cells\n  - Escape to cancel/close panels\n  - Tab navigation through UI controls\n- [x] Add screen reader support (COMPLETED 2026-02-16)\n  - ARIA labels for UI elements\n  - Announce game state changes\n  - Alternative text for visual elements\n  - Live regions for score/timer updates\n- [x] Implement reduced motion support\n  - Respect prefers-reduced-motion media query\n  - Disable animations when requested\n  - Simpl